                                        "sense_id": "6c0cc230-2749-3687-9bb7-8a253fd15c20",
                                        "entry_id": "87427bf6-0eeb-3082-b65e-1140e679db96",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Disastrous, calamitous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "20dbc16e-1c8b-3029-8450-c7226c3c0cf7",
                                        "entry_id": "87427bf6-0eeb-3082-b65e-1140e679db96",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Disappointingly inadequate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4e72253-80f5-42d6-a768-c2e72a124ff6",
                                                "sense_id": "20dbc16e-1c8b-3029-8450-c7226c3c0cf7",
                                                "text": "He received a dismal compensation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c90f41f-ce7e-4474-8611-41b2daf8050c",
                                                "sense_id": "20dbc16e-1c8b-3029-8450-c7226c3c0cf7",
                                                "text": "Liverpool's efforts thereafter had an air of desperation as their dismal 2012 league form continued."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "469e3344-bb27-3430-bcfc-bf0781cee8ab",
                                        "entry_id": "87427bf6-0eeb-3082-b65e-1140e679db96",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Causing despair; gloomy and bleak."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00b704fc-b97e-4afb-9984-1bc861136f16",
                                                "sense_id": "469e3344-bb27-3430-bcfc-bf0781cee8ab",
                                                "text": "The storm made for a dismal weekend"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e28bcab4-36b6-3b13-ae1b-8836377eb748",
                                        "entry_id": "87427bf6-0eeb-3082-b65e-1140e679db96",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Depressing, dreary, cheerless."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27ceace2-7b86-493d-ae24-b5a68b21fb1d",
                                                "sense_id": "e28bcab4-36b6-3b13-ae1b-8836377eb748",
                                                "text": "She was lost in dismal thoughts of despair"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ad80dfb-f5df-49bc-b74d-f382bf9a699d",
                                                "sense_id": "e28bcab4-36b6-3b13-ae1b-8836377eb748",
                                                "text": "So, after a spell, he decided to make the best of it and shoved us into the front parlor. 'Twas a dismal sort of place, with hair wreaths, and wax fruit, and tin lambrekins, and land knows what all. It looked like a tomb and smelt pretty nigh as musty and dead-and-gone."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "dismal",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a937de0-e2a6-3fd6-b314-aee0d75a68a7",
                                        "entry_id": "07145a0f-4b21-3307-9f4a-6d9fb9da1a89",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dreary swamp in eastern North Carolina or Virginia in the United States."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "dated",
                                            "possibly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8cc280b0-a5da-423d-bc9b-a0decfb314db",
                                                "sense_id": "6a937de0-e2a6-3fd6-b314-aee0d75a68a7",
                                                "text": ".[…] the proprietors of all the great unimproved tracts of Swamp lands will form themselves into Drainage Companies, by which method alone can we ever hope to witness the complete reclamation of the dismals of the seaboard. No reasonable doubt can be entertained that the clearing and draining of the lands will produce their usual effects in ameliorating the climate and that the tidal portions of No. Caro- lina may thus[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "139b6f40-0f45-4c62-9723-ffafb44f6ff9",
                                                "sense_id": "6a937de0-e2a6-3fd6-b314-aee0d75a68a7",
                                                "text": "The term \"Dismal\" requires some clarification. At one time, all large swamps in eastern North Carolina were commonly referred to as \"dismals,\" probably because they were so gloomy, dreary, and dark, and there are a lot of swamps or \"dismals\" in eastern North Carolina."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "93c8b08d-d1f3-4340-bb7c-257b0a8f0ab4",
                        "source_entry_id": "d085d32f-7478-3a8f-9119-dd644b6a0c31",
                        "source_sense_id": "f3362be7-1708-37cc-81c3-9ea315cb4391",
                        "target_lang_word": "lugubrious",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lugubrious",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a9a0cbc-b27a-368b-a13f-4535f7cd7ef7",
                                        "entry_id": "77a88ec0-6c0f-36fe-8aa7-d9312467022e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gloomy, mournful or dismal, especially to an exaggerated degree."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cabe8f76-7e39-4447-8b6a-0e74ca7c4ffd",
                                                "sense_id": "8a9a0cbc-b27a-368b-a13f-4535f7cd7ef7",
                                                "text": "His client’s lugubrious expression tipped off the detective that something lurked beneath her optimistic words."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48d8c065-0c75-4247-8a78-8c61c19e6600",
                                                "sense_id": "8a9a0cbc-b27a-368b-a13f-4535f7cd7ef7",
                                                "text": "The exaggeration with darkness imparted to the glooms of this region impressed Henchard more than he had expected. The lugubrious harmony of the spot with his domestic situation was too perfect for him, impatient of effects, scenes, and adumbrations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ab1716a-b7c4-4734-b37c-f3a62290543d",
                                                "sense_id": "8a9a0cbc-b27a-368b-a13f-4535f7cd7ef7",
                                                "text": "There was a touch of insanity in the proceeding, a sense of lugubrious drollery in the sight; and it was not dissipated by somebody on board assuring me earnestly there was a camp of natives—he called them enemies!—hidden out of sight somewhere."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "efad7f00-9eec-4c8e-b7e6-486b1e422f12",
                                                "sense_id": "8a9a0cbc-b27a-368b-a13f-4535f7cd7ef7",
                                                "text": "I poured one big drink in a water glass, and we had slugs. Oh, it was sweet and delicious and worth my whole lugubrious voyage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d8e7ecc-6509-4fb1-824b-5182ad01bb9f",
                                                "sense_id": "8a9a0cbc-b27a-368b-a13f-4535f7cd7ef7",
                                                "text": "The congregation was \"spellbound unto the Meekest of its Members,\" and none more so than Rick himself, who sits in an enraptured trance, nodding his broad head to the cadences of Makepeace's rhetoric, even though every Welsh note of it — to the excited ears and eyes of those around him — is hurled at Rick personally down the length of the aisle, and rammed home with a botched stab of the lugubrious Watermaster forefinger."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
